// expect: exit 0
// An enumeration of 300 variants, more than a byte counts: every ordinal is its position, every
// name finds its variant, and the boundaries (the first, the 256th, the last, one past the last)
// answer as the rest do. Repeated calls, kept alive together, make the garbage collector move and
// free their vectors while the variants stay the same values.

